{
  "id": "E321",
  "title": "Clasping the Buddha’s Feet",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-04-28",
  "synopsis": "“Clasping the Buddha’s Feet” is an expression for people who don’t properly prepare for things.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1031/ae1ca8f7131d2c8698675a0bc64e98b4c2281404.mp3?1555842508",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "临时抱佛脚\n\n保罗：你快帮帮我吧！\n小乐：怎么了？\n保罗：明天有中文考试，但是我什么也没复习。\n小乐：你每次都是临时抱佛脚，这次我不帮你了。\n保罗：这是什么意思？\n小乐：意思就是你做事情总是不提前准备，最后才着急想办法。这个习惯太不好了。",
    "traditional": "臨時抱佛腳\n\n保羅：你快幫幫我吧！\n小樂：怎麼了？\n保羅：明天有中文考試，但是我什麼也沒復習。\n小樂：你每次都是臨時抱佛腳，這次我不幫你了。\n保羅：這是什麼意思？\n小樂：意思就是你做事情總是不提前準備，最後才著急想辦法。這個習慣太不好了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Clasping the Buddha’s Feet"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：你快帮帮我吧！",
      "traditional": "保羅：你快幫幫我吧！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ kuài bāng bāng wǒ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Quickly, help me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小樂：怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: What’s wrong?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：明天有中文考试，但是我什么也没复习。",
      "traditional": "保羅：明天有中文考試，但是我什麼也沒復習。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó míng tiān yǒu zhōng wén kǎo shì dàn shì wǒ shén me yě méi fù xí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I have a Chinese exam tomorrow, but I haven’t reviewed anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：你每次都是临时抱佛脚，这次我不帮你了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你每次都是臨時抱佛腳，這次我不幫你了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ měi cì dōu shì lín shí bào fó jiǎo zhè cì wǒ bù bāng nǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You always clasp at the Buddha's feet at the last minute. I won’t help you this time."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：这是什么意思？",
      "traditional": "保羅：這是什麼意思？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zhè shì shén me yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What does that mean?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：意思就是你做事情总是不提前准备，",
      "traditional": "小樂：意思就是你做事情總是不提前準備，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yì si jiù shì nǐ zuò shì qing zǒng shì bù tí qián zhǔn bèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "最后才着急想办法。",
      "traditional": "最後才著急想辦法。",
      "pinyin": "zuì hòu cái zháo jí xiǎng bàn fǎ",
      "english": "Little Le: It means that you never prepare in advance when you do things, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "这个习惯太不好了。",
      "traditional": "這個習慣太不好了。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge xí guàn tài bù hǎo le",
      "english": ".. and hurriedly try to find a solution at the last minute."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is a really bad habit."
    }
  ],
